<<~ ahu slot=`#/purpose`>>

`receipts.ts` answers a receipt read, a receipt after the engine fell and a session receipt from the ring, the row and the book. A READ, never a dispatch, and no write. The DAM checklist (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/uds-channel-dam`>>) carries its observations.

